WEBVTT

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:05.000
Music videos,

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.920
variety show appearances,

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:10.320
and magazine interviews...

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:17.920
The elected members'
schedules are packed as usual.

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:22.060
Their single is going on sale soon, isn't it?

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:25.100
Meanwhile, we've got nothing to do.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.250
Chieri's outpacing us quickly.

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:33.050
The elected and the unelected, huh?

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:36.240
Well, it was inevitable.

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:41.520
Chieri's good at singing, super cute, and has curves in the right places.

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:46.480
Next to her, not even a miracle would get me elected.

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:51.120
There, there, Makoto.

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:54.460
You're not the only one who wasn't elected.

00:00:57.650 --> 00:00:59.490
You girls gonna splash around all day?

00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:02.750
We don't have time to dwell on the Elections.

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:06.960
The next attack concert is coming up.

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.840
A wind that heeds no master now blows.

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:20.010
Behold, light shines down through the clouds.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:26.350
Wanderers strain their ears to hear

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:31.370
and find the power to follow their own paths.

00:01:31.370 --> 00:01:37.660
Before me, a hill stretches despairingly high.

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:41.980
But if there's to be a future for me,

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:45.490
I cannot turn my back.

00:01:45.490 --> 00:01:48.910
My friend, do you remember?

00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:52.500
Here, where we exchanged vows that day,

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:56.970
flowers are blooming in season.

00:01:57.690 --> 00:02:01.220
A voice that heeds no master calls.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:04.450
Behold, the sun has returned,

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:08.180
gradually stripping the land

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:10.980
of the shadows that had gathered.

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:14.190
Heedless of any master, now is the time.

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:18.490
Yes, we shall set off on our way.

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:24.660
All of us are frail creatures

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:27.720
seeking the shadow of love

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:31.150
and pushing ever onwards.

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:45.340
This is Baltistar, a planet completely under the Entertainment Ban.

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:49.840
Here, resistance forces seeking liberation from militaristic rule

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:53.540
have been embroiled in a lengthy civil war against DES forces.

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:58.460
This is the first attack concert after the General Elections.

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:01.530
The performers will be the elected members!

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:10.250
So our first performance as an elected team will be an attack concert, huh?

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.100
My body's raring for action!

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:13.840
How dashing.

00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:18.070
To prevent the resistance from gaining any more momentum,

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:19.810
we can expect the military to get involved as well.

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:23.100
In response, we will be
strengthening our defense team.

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:26.470
Kanata, you and the 76th
generation will launch in LAS

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:30.060
and defend the concert in conjunction with WOTA's commando unit.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:30.810
Got it.

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:33.600
As for the 77th generation,

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:37.610
I have an important mission for you girls.

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:57.300
This is the 77th generation.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:58.460
Infiltration successful.

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:01.140
WOTA's intel was correct.

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:05.100
The transport was carrying
boys bound for forced labor.

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:13.810
Your target, Vegastar, is a D.G.T.O. military base constructed to maintain stability on Baltistar.

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:18.560
For some reason, there have been reports of high government officials,

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:22.320
powerful businessmen, investors, and academics visiting this place.

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:26.080
Your mission is to investigate these reports.

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:31.280
All further contact will be carried out via an encrypted channel.

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:33.810
Godspeed.

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:36.250
This is our big moment.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:38.200
An undercover operation, huh?

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.210
My heart's pounding.

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:42.870
Do you think our disguises will work?

00:04:42.870 --> 00:04:44.290
Of course they will.

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:47.470
This is where our acting training pays off.

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:50.430
We'll take on any dangers that lie in store for us!

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:53.340
Come on, you punks! Let's do this!

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:54.480
Y-Yeah!

00:04:55.010 --> 00:05:00.400
Still, this is a dangerous and frightening undercover mission...

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:06.860
All of their IDs check out.

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:08.590
Lieutenant.

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:09.360
Right.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:14.940
You brats are going to be working odd jobs for the supply corps.

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:19.260
If you want to go home sooner, then you'd better put your backs into it.

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:20.430
Yes, sir!

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:21.340
Private Higashino!

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:25.240
Yes, sir?

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:28.720
I'm putting you in charge of these boots.

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:30.590
Show them the ropes.

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:36.520
Aye aye, sir!

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:56.370
Chieri!

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:59.450
Why the long face?

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:01.340
We'll be on stage in just a while.

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:02.250
Yuuko-san.

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:05.920
Worried about our little undercover agents?

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:08.540
Not at all.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:12.430
I'm in no position to be worrying about others.

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:16.620
That's the spirit!

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:18.140
I like it!

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:21.190
C'mon! Put yer back in it!

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:24.650
I-I'm gonna put <i>out</i> my back...

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:27.730
Pick up the pace or yer gonna be here forever!

00:06:27.730 --> 00:06:29.200
S-Sir!

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:36.260
There's a whole lot—a helluva lot of clothes.

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:37.510
Y-Yeah, man.

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:39.340
Here ya go. Next load.

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:41.380
Chop chop, get it moving.

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:45.350
Dang... dude.

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:52.650
Yer pathetic. That ain't even heavy.

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:56.660
M-My back...

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:57.360
I can't do this.

00:06:57.360 --> 00:06:59.480
Yer a crop o' useless 'cruits, you lot.

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:03.580
Don't expect any grub till ya get this work done.

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:04.660
Sheesh.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:08.740
Why do I gotta babysit these runts?

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.200
That asshole lieutenant!

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:13.700
That old man's annoying!

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.840
This work sure isn't easy.

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:18.580
Huh? Where's Makoto?

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:21.380
Where did she get off to?

00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:28.610
Take that, take that, take that!

00:07:25.060 --> 00:07:26.170
Makoto?

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:27.630
What's gotten into you?

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:29.740
You're more pumped up than usual.

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:31.630
Do you enjoy scrubbing toilets?

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:34.700
Who cares if I've gotta scrub toilets or whatever?

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:37.140
I'm just a lowly unelected member.

00:07:39.050 --> 00:07:40.130
Girls!

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:45.200
The <i>Katyusha</i> has given us the signal to start the operation.

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:46.060
Dude!

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:49.100
00 attack on Baltistar!

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:51.530
I repeat, 00 attack on Baltistar!

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:53.380
Interception squad, move out!

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:56.370
Suppress all entertainment activities at once!

00:07:58.050 --> 00:07:59.550
It's started.

00:07:59.550 --> 00:08:00.480
Yeah.

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:03.860
All right then. Time to split into teams and begin our mission.

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:04.670
Roger!

00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:09.380
All right everyone!

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:11.650
Let's make it wild!

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:16.260
One, two, three, four!

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:37.560
Listen to the music pounding in your head.

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:47.560
They're here!

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:48.920
All units, fan out!

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.150
Roger!

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:57.320
Just like popping popcorn,

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:57.320
popcorn ga hajikeru you ni

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:55.620
This is the New General Election members' first concert.

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:57.200
You're not gonna get in their way!

00:08:57.320 --> 00:09:02.370
the word "love" dances in midair.

00:08:57.320 --> 00:09:02.370
suki to iu moji ga odoru

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:18.660
What's this place?

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:21.610
Looks like a hangar.

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:23.580
This whole area?

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:29.460
"Heavy Rotation"?

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:35.170
You're right. It's "Heavy Rotation".

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:40.420
Why would a 00 song be playing in a DES base?

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:42.890
Maybe they're monitoring the guerrilla concert.

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:46.630
We'd better take a look.

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:49.940
Come on!

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:51.140
It's not working?

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:53.120
Hey, what about that?

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:56.530
Nice idea, Makoto.

00:09:57.390 --> 00:09:59.280
It's getting louder.

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.140
It's begun!

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:03.830
Here's today's main race!

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:07.540
Baltistar, where entertainment
is strictly prohibited...

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:11.630
How will 00 respond in the face of the military might of Vegastar?

00:10:12.230 --> 00:10:16.050
The main force will consist of DES's pride and joy, its unmanned Zodiac battle mechas.

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:19.460
DES's elite commandos are also raring to go!

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:24.220
How many minutes will 00 be
able to continue their concert?

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:26.040
Ten thousand on five minutes!

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:27.320
Fifty thousand on ten minutes!

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:29.150
A hundred thousand on twenty minutes!

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:39.610
<i>That's the guerrilla concert they're holding right now!</i>

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:42.620
<i>What's this about how many minutes it can continue?</i>

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:45.080
<i>This is... a casino!</i>

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:46.840
<i>No doubt about it...</i>

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:49.250
<i>They're betting money on 00's concerts.</i>

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:50.480
<i>No way!</i>

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:52.880
<i>Our concerts are being used for </i>this?

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:54.300
<i>Then, this means...</i>

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:57.260
<i>It's an illegal underground casino.</i>

00:10:57.790 --> 00:11:00.500
<i>Is that the secret of this place?</i>

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:01.260
<i>Those hypocrites!</i>

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:05.840
<i>On the surface, they're against entertainment, but they're making a killing behind the scenes!</i>

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:08.140
<i>Yuuka?</i>

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:10.760
<i>Let's move in and get a closer look.</i>

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:18.150
No!

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:19.110
Makoto!

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:25.840
An intruder in the casino?

00:11:25.840 --> 00:11:27.390
Who <i>is</i> that?

00:11:30.490 --> 00:11:31.460
She's a 00 member!

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:35.460
00? Don't let them get away!

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:39.400
That's...

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:48.800
This is as far as you go.

00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:50.270
Give yourselves up.

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:53.220
Don't make me laugh!

00:11:53.220 --> 00:11:56.110
As if we'd listen to a bunch of lowlifes like you!

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:05.070
What?!

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:10.630
Dear, dear.

00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:16.750
00 members have infiltrated the base!

00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:19.510
You are ordered to capture them on sight!

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:21.120
Wha—

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:24.220
They found Nagisa's team?

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:25.590
I hope they're okay.

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:30.080
Girls, do you read me?

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:30.930
Yuuka?

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:33.860
Thank goodness you're safe.

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:35.590
Pee-yew!

00:12:35.590 --> 00:12:37.360
We're supposed to communicate in code.

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:39.190
This is not the time to worry about that!

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:41.690
An illegal casino?

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:43.290
Affirmative.

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:46.450
They're even betting on 00's concerts.

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:51.240
So the D.G.T.O. is making immense profit

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:55.080
by supporting illegal entertainment on the black market.

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.420
It all makes sense now.

00:12:57.320 --> 00:13:00.420
Those occasions when DES's
assault was unnaturally weak

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:04.380
were just to make the gamble more exciting, weren't they?

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:08.890
00 has stolen vital D.G.T.O. secrets and escaped!

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:11.180
Don't let a single one get away!

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:13.120
Look at all those soldiers.

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:15.800
How do we escape through <i>that?</i>

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:18.570
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:13:18.570 --> 00:13:20.570
This is all because I was clumsy.

00:13:21.470 --> 00:13:22.530
Makoto...

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:25.560
Nothing about me is right,
and nothing I do goes right either.

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:27.220
I'm just trash.

00:13:27.220 --> 00:13:28.490
Complete rubbish.

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:31.640
You can leave me here in
this dump where I belong!

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:33.030
Don't give up!

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:35.460
We haven't completed our mission yet!

00:13:48.690 --> 00:13:51.200
Total domination!

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:53.850
We'll start looking for a way to get out of here.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:14:00.000
The elected members, Kanata-san, and the others are out there risking their lives.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:03.930
Now that we've discovered the twisted purpose their efforts are being put to,

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:06.180
how can we run away without you?

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:08.180
I absolutely refuse to!

00:14:09.690 --> 00:14:10.960
Orine...

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:11.780
Found it.

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:17.250
There's a massive nuclear reactor in the center of this asteroid.

00:14:17.770 --> 00:14:24.250
If we can shut it down, it'll cut off the power supply, possibly causing a mass blackout.

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:26.060
A mass blackout?

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:30.900
That'll take out the cameras and security systems!

00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:32.220
And the casino, too!

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:35.600
It's a bit aggressive, but that's how 00 does things!

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:36.930
Yeah. Let's do this!

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:40.240
Goodness, events have taken a shocking turn!

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:41.970
and the current may be strong,

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:44.570
It appears 00 is aiming to shut down the
reactor and use that opportunity to escape!

00:14:42.970 --> 00:14:46.060
but don't fear.

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:48.580
Ladies and gentlemen, looks like we have a surprise race on our hands!

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:48.140
If it carries you away,

00:14:48.140 --> 00:14:52.480
just remember, the other shore will catch you.

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:54.440
Can 00 make it to the reactor?

00:14:52.480 --> 00:15:01.030
Have faith in yourself.

00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:57.600
Or will DES forces stop them in their tracks?

00:14:57.600 --> 00:15:00.450
Place your bets now!

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:10.340
We need to draw the DES forces away from the reactor.

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:10.000
Don't make excuses!

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:12.820
Um, you mean we need a bellboy?

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:14.960
You won't know until you try!

00:15:12.820 --> 00:15:14.540
What will we do with a bellboy?

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:15.440
I think you mean decoy.

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:16.270
Oh, right.

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:18.170
We have to keep going!

00:15:18.170 --> 00:15:19.970
Keep on, keep on, keep on

00:15:19.970 --> 00:15:21.090
walking along

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:22.800
the path you chose!

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:22.460
Hey.

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:27.100
Within your heart,

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.340
Can't we use that?

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:28.930
there flows a river:

00:15:28.930 --> 00:15:33.520
A river of sweat and tears!

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:32.420
Chieri!

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:33.490
It's Chieri-chan!

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:36.530
Even if you fail,

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:40.650
even if you're washed away,

00:15:40.590 --> 00:15:41.370
Chieri!

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:42.620
Mimori-san!

00:15:41.780 --> 00:15:44.620
just try again.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:43.330
Kanata!

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:46.790
Don't falter now.

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:48.340
You can't go down yet!

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:50.920
Hang on to your dreams

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:50.960
We don't want the fans to worry!

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:58.420
until the day they come true.

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:52.760
Come on, smile!

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:55.970
Mimori-chan!

00:15:58.420 --> 00:15:59.550
Cross that river!

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:13.910
There are so many DES troops.

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:16.220
We can't even get close.

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:24.880
We've arrived at the reactor.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:25.940
We have visual of DES troops.

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:27.460
Wh-Where are the brakes?

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:27.960
Here, right?

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:35.080
Oh? It's Orine's team!

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:37.100
Here's our chance. Move out!

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:38.210
Roger!

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:49.920
Amazing.

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:54.720
On the other hand, I'm just...

00:16:54.720 --> 00:16:55.800
There it is!

00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:58.920
Makocchi's signature move: the face-in-the-knees!

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:03.700
Ya can't beat seeing Makocchi's gloominess in person.

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:04.460
Higashino-san?

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:07.070
I went outta my way to save you, ya know?

00:17:07.070 --> 00:17:09.540
Why're ya running off into danger again?

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.960
I'm glad I caught a glimpse of something special, though.

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:13.740
Saved us...?

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:15.760
I'm one of DES's closet 00 fans!

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:19.180
Private Higashino, at yer service!

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:21.930
Don't tell the officers, o' course.

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:26.400
Well, yer teammates are off fighting.

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:28.230
What're ya doing here, Makocchi?

00:17:29.430 --> 00:17:33.140
I'd only get in their way.

00:17:34.290 --> 00:17:36.300
I'm useless as an idol.

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:37.810
I was even useless to this mission.

00:17:37.810 --> 00:17:41.120
No matter what I do, I'm utterly useless at it.

00:17:42.630 --> 00:17:44.800
Useless through-and-through, eh?

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:47.830
Yer an embarrassment to the rest of us Naniwastar folks.

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:53.400
Ya can't nail a punchline, yer yellow-
bellied, and ya act like a buffoon.

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:55.670
You didn't have to spell it out!

00:17:57.750 --> 00:17:59.260
But even so,

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:04.310
I wanted to support a coward like you, so I voted for ya in the Elections.

00:18:05.110 --> 00:18:06.340
For me?

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:09.180
You bet! Four times!

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:15.580
I had to save up the peanuts they pay us!

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:17.360
Besides, voting ain't about numbers!

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:20.420
It's about heart! It's about love! Ain't it?

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:21.620
R-Right!

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:24.740
But why a coward like me?

00:18:26.570 --> 00:18:28.510
Funny how it happened.

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:33.600
You were like a flightless bird, embarrassing yourself and completely useless.

00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:37.720
But ya never tried to hide it, and ya never got your act together.

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:46.780
As I watched yer endless failure, something warm stirred inside my listless heart.

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:50.090
You've encouraged me a lot, Makocchi.

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:53.700
Higashino-san...

00:18:57.890 --> 00:18:59.070
Looks like they're having trouble.

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:05.790
If they manage to pull the emergency control lever at the bottom, it'll stop the reactor.

00:19:08.270 --> 00:19:09.040
Higashino-san.

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:12.210
Makoto?!

00:19:12.590 --> 00:19:14.590
What's she doing there?

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:18.260
That's the control module?

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:20.220
If ya pull the lever in the middle...

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:22.050
Between classes, the girls gather round,

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:22.050
yasumi jikan ni joshi ga zasshi mekutte

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:21.930
...it'll cause a mass blackout.

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:23.600
This is a bad idea, Makocchi.

00:19:22.270 --> 00:19:24.520
chatting over magazines.

00:19:22.270 --> 00:19:24.520
shabette iru yo

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:25.140
Let's call it quits!

00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:28.570
There, sitting at the outskirts of the circle,

00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:28.570
chiisa na wa no naka hashikko ni suwatte

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:26.890
It's way too dangerous!

00:19:28.570 --> 00:19:31.270
you were smiling.

00:19:28.570 --> 00:19:31.270
waratteru kimi

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:30.140
I've got nothing to lose!

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:34.990
If we held a popularity contest in our class,

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:34.990
uchi no kurasu de ninki touhyou shitemo

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:35.110
I can't fly like the others,

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:37.190
you wouldn't rank high.

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:37.190
joui janai

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:38.300
and I'm not optimistic at all...

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:41.360
When it comes to academics and sports, you're about average.

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:41.360
benkyou to ka supootsu mo chuu kurai de

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:43.770
You don't really stand out.

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:43.770
medatanai taipu

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:45.370
So I'll just be pessimistic!

00:19:43.770 --> 00:19:46.560
But, for some reason,

00:19:43.770 --> 00:19:46.560
dakedo nazeka

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:50.190
I can't stop thinking about you.

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:50.190
zutto ki ni naru nda yo

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:50.920
I'll turn toward tomorrow and fail with all my might!

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:55.040
That's right, no matter where I go...

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:55.040
sou doko ni itemo...

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:51.750
u

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:52.920
As the understudy in charge of being in the pits,

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:57.670
I, Yokomizo Makoto, will fall away!

00:19:56.690 --> 00:20:01.840
You're the one for me.

00:19:56.690 --> 00:20:01.840
kimi ga ii

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:06.330
You can give me all the beauties of the world

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:06.330
donna sekaijuu no bijotachi yori

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:07.280
<i>A Kirara?</i>

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:09.350
but I won't choose them over you.

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:09.350
kuraberarenai kurai

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:14.020
You're the one for me.

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:14.020
kimi ga ii

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:16.110
Take that!

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:19.040
Love is your own diamond.

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:19.040
koi wa jibun dake no daiyamondo

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:22.320
You find it where you least expect it.

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:22.320
katte ni mitsukeru mono sa

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:21.740
Darn it! She missed!

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:26.280
We each have our own value.

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:26.280
sorezore no value

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:33.370
I have my own unique value.

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:33.370
boku dake no value

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:31.080
One more shot!

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:36.920
She did it!

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:39.580
She did it!

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:40.630
Mission success!

00:20:40.990 --> 00:20:42.620
Not bad, Grumbly!

00:20:42.620 --> 00:20:44.820
I think I'll upgrade you to Grumblator!

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:45.640
Amazing!

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:46.500
She did it!

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:51.320
My, what an unbelievable upset!

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:53.560
00's plan has succeeded!

00:21:07.730 --> 00:21:09.030
There it is! The airlock!

00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:16.370
Higashino-san?

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:20.840
With the power out, someone's gotta crank it by hand.

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:23.550
So long, Makocchi.

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:26.180
I'll always be yer fan!

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:34.180
Thank you so much!

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:52.620
Leaks concerning the casino have been dealt with by way of a strict gag rule.

00:21:54.010 --> 00:22:00.380
However, now that 00 has found out, a scandal is nearly inevitable.

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:01.420
No matter.

00:22:02.070 --> 00:22:06.640
The data we received was more than worth the risk.

00:22:08.230 --> 00:22:12.600
The apex of life, the
Kirara's glow, huh?

00:22:23.690 --> 00:22:28.150
The wish from that day

00:22:23.690 --> 00:22:28.150
itsuka no negai wa

00:22:28.150 --> 00:22:32.860
sleeps in the ground.

00:22:28.150 --> 00:22:32.860
tsuchi no naka de nemutte

00:22:32.860 --> 00:22:37.240
When the promised time comes,

00:22:32.860 --> 00:22:37.240
yakusoku no jikoku ni

00:22:37.240 --> 00:22:42.000
it shall sprout a bud of hope.

00:22:37.240 --> 00:22:42.000
kibou no me ga deru nda

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:45.920
Back when we first met,

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:45.920
futari ga deatta koro

00:22:45.920 --> 00:22:51.010
our dreams were but seeds.

00:22:45.920 --> 00:22:51.010
yume nado mada tane datta

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:54.930
How long will it take

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:54.930
dore kurai toki ga sugi

00:22:54.930 --> 00:23:00.520
before they finally bloom?

00:22:54.930 --> 00:23:00.520
hana wa saku no darou

00:23:01.060 --> 00:23:05.650
I offer my tears to you.

00:23:01.060 --> 00:23:05.650
kono namida wo kimi ni sasagu

00:23:05.650 --> 00:23:10.190
If it will help you glow with greater radiance,

00:23:05.650 --> 00:23:10.190
motto kimi ga kagayaku nara

00:23:10.190 --> 00:23:12.570
then from up here, in this silent sky,

00:23:10.190 --> 00:23:12.570
zutto mimamotteta

00:23:12.570 --> 00:23:15.660
where I've been watching over you,

00:23:12.570 --> 00:23:15.660
chinmoku no sora kara

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:20.240
I shall now fall as rain.

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:20.240
ima boku wa ame ni narou

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:23.750
Ah, I'll offer them to you.

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:23.750
a, kimi ni sasagu

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:28.340
All that I can do right now

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:28.340
konna boku ni dekiru koto wa

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:33.760
is ease the emptiness you feel, if only a little.

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:33.760
kimi no munashisa wo sukoshi demo iyasu koto

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:38.720
And so, I shall fall as rain.

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:38.720
saa boku wa ame ni narou

00:23:45.780 --> 00:23:46.860
At your ervice-say!

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:50.740
I'm the former Minegishi Minami the 5th, aka Mii-chan!

00:23:50.740 --> 00:23:53.140
I'm not going to lose either!

00:23:53.140 --> 00:23:55.370
She had more in her than that.

00:23:55.370 --> 00:23:59.600
You haven't matched Acchan the 13th's radiance yet!

00:23:57.790 --> 00:24:00.000
- Inheritor of the Name -
